Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.27,0:00:11.10,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.85,0:00:17.95,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你们暗塌谷帝国为什么要做这种事？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.88,0:00:23.93,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我们的所爱 希望我们这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.24,0:00:30.54,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！来了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.20,0:02:17.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}跨越迷茫 不成熟的英雄！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.78,0:02:20.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有劳你特地跑一趟
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.26,0:02:22.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是奉国王陛下的命啦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.25,0:02:29.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,陛下吩咐说“这是关系到蓝天大地命运的研究成果 务必要完好取回"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.25,0:02:29.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(820,960)}{\fs50}Skyland
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.28,0:02:33.72,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,有点为时过早了 还在研究中呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.24,0:02:36.23,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,研究 是什么研究？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.56,0:02:39.36,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,关于产生闪亮能量的研究
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.88,0:02:42.27,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,还能办到这种事情吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.64,0:02:44.58,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 理论上没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.85,0:02:49.06,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,净化凶暴兽时所释出的闪亮能量
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.41,0:02:51.22,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,能够修复被破坏的物品
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.41,0:02:54.01,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,还能与暗塌谷能量抗衡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.36,0:02:58.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}研究笔记
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.28,0:03:02.98,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,如果能用天空石产生大量的闪亮能量
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.28,0:03:02.98,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(800,960)}{\fs50}Sky Jewel
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.41,0:03:07.86,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,甚至可以通过魔镜平板来生成保护蓝天大地城镇的护罩
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.63,0:03:15.75,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,既能防止敌人通过通道入侵城市 又能抵御外部的攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.90,0:03:22.65,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,简单点说 就是让城市完全变成安全地带 能够保护人民！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.09,0:03:24.68,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.17,0:03:31.76,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,还不止这些 研究顺利的话 还能够净化凶暴兽
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.17,0:03:35.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这还是第一次听说呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.83,0:03:40.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是说 我们蓝色护卫队也能实现净化？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.10,0:03:42.13,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.01,0:03:46.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮大忙了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.34,0:03:51.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了不起啊 靠着一个人就研究到这个程度
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.48,0:03:54.67,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,毕竟一直把自己关在房间里 刻苦钻研啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.07,0:03:56.73,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,不错啊 少年
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.08,0:03:59.19,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,啪啪啪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.21,0:04:05.63,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,靠一个人...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.73,0:04:12.15,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,现在还在研究中 我会在傍晚把资料归纳好的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.90,0:04:14.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.70,0:04:17.98,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是说 中间这段时间空出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.73,0:04:19.86,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,那不如...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.34,0:04:31.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变成让大家带我逛街了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.53,0:04:36.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我穿这套衣服怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.20,0:04:38.19,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.50,0:04:40.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好不好看？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.08,0:04:43.37,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 非... 非常漂亮！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.69,0:04:45.59,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哈... 哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.33,0:04:48.71,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 小蝶的衣服正正好好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.88,0:04:50.90,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,同一套 穿着比我更正呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.06,0:04:55.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么要带我去哪里呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.33,0:04:58.50,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是一个好地方
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.50,0:05:03.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}天窗市 购物中心
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.91,0:05:06.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,建筑物里有市场？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.91,0:05:06.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}欢迎复习第二集
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.11,0:05:09.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,楼梯自己在动...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.46,0:05:11.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎光临
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.37,0:05:14.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人偶居然在说话
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.32,0:05:17.80,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小帕小帕 服装市场在几楼？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.48,0:05:22.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嚯... 材料的拉伸性这么好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.81,0:05:36.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要与你无可替代的伙伴们 一同走你们自己的英雄之路
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.23,0:05:41.44,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,队长她好像玩得很开心...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.90,0:05:43.32,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.55,0:05:52.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有时间吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.49,0:05:55.44,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.67,0:06:03.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想试试运动服的性能 有没有打乱你的安排
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.56,0:06:04.92,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,没有的事！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.39,0:06:09.19,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,能和飒拉拉队长一起锻炼 是我的光荣！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.65,0:06:13.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯... 在开始锻炼前
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.68,0:06:17.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,需要认真做好热身运动
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.11,0:06:21.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}（树丛声响...）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.29,0:06:21.31,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.59,0:06:23.64,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,你在这里做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.04,0:06:25.29,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嘘！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.34,0:06:27.33,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.70,0:06:36.39,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,运动社团在运动呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.30,0:06:38.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说说看
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.73,0:06:39.77,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.98,0:06:41.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遇到什么事了？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.58,0:06:43.19,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,什么... 什么事...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.51,0:06:45.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看起来想隐瞒的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.14,0:06:49.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正直的英雄哪会说谎啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.19,0:06:56.67,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我就问一下... 大伙在这里做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.41,0:07:00.69,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,嘘！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.89,0:07:04.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,究竟在为什么烦恼？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.94,0:07:08.65,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,有一瞬间 我忘记了自己正在战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.52,0:07:16.69,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我们的所爱 希望我们这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.22,0:07:18.35,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.38,0:07:20.52,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,幼稚
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.77,0:07:22.16,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky 危险！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.53,0:07:28.23,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我自己也不知道是为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.06,0:07:32.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样啊 你是在思索这个答案
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.87,0:07:34.76,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.58,0:07:39.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说过的吧 "走你们自己的英雄之路"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.86,0:07:42.14,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,"要与无可替代的伙伴们一同"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.70,0:07:46.31,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我明白的 应该找伙伴们商量
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.15,0:07:48.41,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.15,0:07:51.64,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,这次不行
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.57,0:07:58.29,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我要一个人思考 靠自己找到答案
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.01,0:08:01.20,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,又来了吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.50,0:08:03.45,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,阿翼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.12,0:08:05.36,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,等等...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.50,0:08:07.25,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 冷静点
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.54,0:08:09.55,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我们一起商量嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.55,0:08:13.30,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,说什么一个人去找答案...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.84,0:08:19.10,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不是伙伴吗 你也太见外了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.74,0:08:23.75,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,想要一个人承担 你只是在逞强！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.14,0:08:31.83,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,或许你说的对
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.73,0:08:38.83,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 这次一定要靠我自己来思考
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.77,0:08:42.27,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,要是无法向一人之下出拳
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.69,0:08:44.77,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我是无法直面我自己的...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.09,0:08:48.29,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是无法找到答案的！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.63,0:08:56.67,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,少年不也是 一个人努力下来的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.84,0:08:58.82,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,一个人完成了闪亮能量的研究
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.97,0:09:01.52,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,那件事和现在这件事 不能相提而论吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.90,0:09:04.58,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,毕竟做研究嘛 只有我能够办到
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.85,0:09:06.12,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,哪不一样了？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.41,0:09:09.83,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴的感情 只有小晴自己懂
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.29,0:09:13.35,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,你是觉得小晴找不到答案？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.55,0:09:15.16,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.55,0:09:16.59,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.21,0:09:21.35,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴 如果有我们能帮到的 你尽管说
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.00,0:09:25.37,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,你尽情地思考 尽管去烦恼吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.09,0:09:32.75,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,如果有能和我们商量的事情 就来找我们吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.41,0:09:35.93,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！嘻嘻嘻...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.24,0:09:52.42,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.29,0:09:58.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要有这研究和舒适的运动服 我们便是无敌的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.72,0:10:00.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和平一定能够到来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.43,0:10:04.72,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,你很中意运动服呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.86,0:10:09.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你肯定能找到答案的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.45,0:10:11.82,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 谢谢你了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.34,0:10:13.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别停下脚步
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.97,0:10:15.70,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.31,0:10:40.29,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,找不到啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.48,0:10:42.04,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哪有答案啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.25,0:10:44.77,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,究竟该怎么办！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.97,0:10:46.05,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.20,0:10:48.05,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,烦恼都爆表了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.45,0:10:49.52,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.69,0:10:51.21,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,完全没进展呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.81,0:10:55.17,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,她大概需要喘口气
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.17,0:10:57.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}唯美着迷
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.92,0:11:00.73,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天购物的时候才过来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.13,0:11:03.15,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我有事没有一起来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.36,0:11:07.17,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,少年 最近一直把自己关在房间里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.10,0:11:10.47,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,今天就尽情地舒展翅膀吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.87,0:11:11.93,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.48,0:11:15.92,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,去哪里呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.99,0:11:23.30,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,一人之下！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.48,0:11:28.49,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,听说你们在研究闪亮能量
