Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.14,0:14:06.15,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,凶暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.95,0:14:10.14,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.50,0:14:12.74,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,凶...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.90,0:14:14.03,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.35,0:14:15.09,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.26,0:14:17.06,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.32,0:14:18.20,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,凶暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.36,0:14:18.93,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,还好吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.12,0:14:20.36,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,还行...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.97,0:14:22.74,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,凶暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.80,0:14:31.15,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,没有集中精神战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.73,0:14:33.62,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,和上次一样吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.98,0:14:37.03,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么动不了... 我...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.25,0:14:38.57,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.94,0:14:42.25,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,凶暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.10,0:14:48.93,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,说出来不就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.83,0:14:50.87,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.22,0:14:54.57,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 不是跟我说 去跟一人之下说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.13,0:14:55.97,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,凶！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.11,0:15:00.53,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,你那么在意他的话 不如去问个清楚？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.23,0:15:03.75,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,问个清楚...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.64,0:15:07.80,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,去找一人之下问个清楚...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.43,0:15:15.56,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.12,0:15:18.04,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,把Sky送到一人之下那边！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.50,0:15:21.46,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,让她跟一人之下对话！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.16,0:15:24.13,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.42,0:15:29.27,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,送Sky过去 就是我们这些伙伴 现在能帮你做到的事吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.87,0:15:32.20,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Prism... 大伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.72,0:15:34.20,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,一口气冲过去！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.40,0:15:44.37,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,双色合一！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.68,0:15:45.57,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,白色！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.68,0:15:45.57,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}White！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.46,0:15:48.39,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,黄色！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.46,0:15:48.39,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Yellow！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.16,0:15:54.76,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,速度的力量 飞扬起来！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.52,0:16:00.19,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,去吧 Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.54,0:16:01.42,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.87,0:16:05.22,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,凶！凶！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.22,0:16:08.21,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,凶！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.00,0:16:11.19,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.29,0:16:14.40,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,凶暴兽我们来应付！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.91,0:16:15.93,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.07,0:16:19.07,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.51,0:16:20.59,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,哒！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.94,0:16:21.81,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.67,0:16:28.01,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,雕虫小技
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.34,0:16:32.76,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.83,0:16:42.58,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.75,0:16:43.76,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.09,0:16:45.48,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直在思考
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.39,0:16:48.71,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我为什么会露出破绽
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.78,0:16:54.03,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我们的所爱 希望我们这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.50,0:16:57.32,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是因为我听到了你说的话...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.11,0:17:02.13,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,是知晓了我等战斗的理由 胆怯了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.35,0:17:03.70,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,疑惑到了今天
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.27,0:17:07.28,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我在想 你也是为了某人而战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.18,0:17:10.61,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是跟我们一样的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.25,0:17:12.77,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,那又如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.94,0:17:17.05,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真是这样的话 我们是不是不用再战斗了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.49,0:17:19.72,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,幼稚无比
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.88,0:17:21.78,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,居然操心战斗的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.45,0:17:24.40,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,唔！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.83,0:17:37.78,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,和上次一样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.99,0:17:42.18,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,因为疑问犹豫 而对战斗产生迷茫
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.68,0:17:48.99,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你看好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.33,0:17:52.62,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你的迷茫 这座城市将灰飞烟灭
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.54,0:17:55.31,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,那你为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.45,0:17:56.54,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,就不会迷茫？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.83,0:17:58.19,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,就没有烦恼？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.01,0:18:03.59,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,为他人而战斗的你 究竟为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.96,0:18:07.19,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么 能够去伤害别人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.49,0:18:10.43,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么 能够让人们苦恼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.39,0:18:12.72,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.54,0:18:17.99,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,即将消失的你 没有知道的必要
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.24,0:18:26.28,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,对交战对手的兴趣 这件事的本身 我并不否定
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.00,0:18:30.44,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,但是你的兴趣是感情驱动的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.00,0:18:32.63,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,城市会消失
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.20,0:18:38.95,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,这一切都是你引起了 咒骂你自己的幼稚吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.75,0:18:41.90,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,如果这就是不成熟的表现...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.93,0:18:44.69,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不成熟就不成熟吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.79,0:18:51.62,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,就是因为不成熟 我才想知晓
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.56,0:18:54.07,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,正是因为不成熟...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.47,0:18:58.23,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,才要不再踌躇 才要勇往直前！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.94,0:19:04.16,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,如果思考烦恼 代表着不成熟
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.59,0:19:05.68,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,那就不成熟吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.27,0:19:07.56,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,这才是...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.52,0:19:10.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走你们自己的英雄之路
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.99,0:19:13.57,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我与伙伴们一同要走的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.42,0:19:16.67,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的英雄之路！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.33,0:19:23.97,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女·天空拳！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.33,0:19:23.97,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Hero Girl Sky Punch！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.14,0:19:26.76,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.22,0:19:30.68,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.84,0:19:33.66,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.23,0:19:42.52,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,这力量...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.84,0:19:49.04,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,一人之下 我们来谈谈吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.54,0:19:54.44,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,凶暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.54,0:20:01.75,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,一人之下！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.60,0:20:03.63,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
