Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.61,0:22:09.02,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是我 Cure Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.61,0:22:09.02,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1080,960)}天空愈卫
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.59,0:22:12.63,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,大家和我一起跳吧！
