Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.43,0:23:48.50,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,孟达就是虚蜢达？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.43,0:23:48.50,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(770,960)}纹田
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.96,0:23:51.68,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我曾认为自己一无所有
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.98,0:23:53.79,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 我现在想像那个人一样
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.97,0:23:55.76,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,为苦恼中的人们 加油助威！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.15,0:23:58.08,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经做好了思想觉悟！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.97,0:24:00.46,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Hirogaru Sky！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.97,0:24:00.46,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}海阔天空！光之美少女
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.46,0:24:03.21,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,棱镜虹光！照亮心灵！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.46,0:24:03.21,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(770,960)}Prism shine
